{"id":"n2-027","title":"Noun にて (Noun nite)","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Expresses location or means; 'at', 'in', 'by', 'with'.","longExplanation":"The にて grammar point is used to indicate the location, means, or method of an action. It can be translated as 'at', 'in', 'by', or 'with' in English. It functions similarly to the particle で, but にて is more formal and often used in written language, formal speaking, and announcements.","formation":"Noun + にて","examples":[{"jp":"駅前広場にてイベントが開催されます。","romaji":"Ekimae hiroba nite ibento ga kaisai saremasu.","en":"An event will be held at the station square.","words":[{"surface":"駅前","vocabId":"1175170","reading":"えきまえ"},{"surface":"広場","vocabId":"1278590","reading":"ひろば"},{"surface":"にて","vocabId":null},{"surface":"イベント","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"開催","vocabId":"1202710","reading":"かいさい"},{"surface":"さ","vocabId":"1291070","reading":"さ","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"れ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"れる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2]},{"jp":"ホテルにて会議が行われます。","romaji":"Hoteru nite kaigi ga okonawaremasu.","en":"The meeting will take place at the hotel.","words":[{"surface":"ホテル","vocabId":"1194010","reading":"ほてる"},{"surface":"にて","vocabId":null},{"surface":"会議","vocabId":"1198360","reading":"かいぎ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行わ","vocabId":"1589060","reading":"おこなう","baseForm":"行う"},{"surface":"れ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"れる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1]},{"jp":"郵便局にて荷物を受け取りました。","romaji":"Yubinkyoku nite nimotsu wo uketorimashita.","en":"I received the package at the post office.","words":[{"surface":"郵便","vocabId":"1605680","reading":"ゆうびん"},{"surface":"局","vocabId":"1239560","reading":"きょく"},{"surface":"にて","vocabId":null},{"surface":"荷物","vocabId":"1195430","reading":"にもつ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"受け取り","vocabId":"1329770","reading":"うけとり","baseForm":"受け取る"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2]},{"jp":"インターネットにて調べたら、答えが見つかりました。","romaji":"Intaanetto nite shirabetara, kotae ga mitsukarimashita.","en":"I searched online and found the answer.","words":[{"surface":"インターネット","vocabId":null},{"surface":"にて","vocabId":null},{"surface":"調べ","vocabId":"1429050","reading":"しらべ","baseForm":"調べる"},{"surface":"たら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"た"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"答え","vocabId":"1449530","reading":"こたえ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"見つかり","vocabId":"1604550","reading":"みつかる","baseForm":"見つかる"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1]}],"formalityLevel":"very-formal-literary","usageNote":"Formal, literary \"at/in/by\" - ceremonies, formal writing, old-fashioned register.","family":{"id":"formal-location","name":"Formal Location (At / In, Official Register)","relatedPoints":["n2-107","n1-097","n1-110"]}}